OL,3,GTayside
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cloudy day that will
OL,6,Fbegin with outbreaks of locally heavy
OL,7,Frain. This rain will clear from the
OL,8,Fsouth during the morning, leaving
OL,9,Flight rain or drizzle over the hills
OL,10,Ffor a time. Light rain will clear by
OL,11,Fmid-afternoon. Maximum Temperature 10C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe evening will continue dry
OL,14,Fwith the odd clear spell. Cloud will
OL,15,Fincrease again as light rain or
OL,16,Fdrizzle returns from the late evening.
OL,17,FMinimum Temperature 4C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
