OL,3,GTayside
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FAnother cloudy day with light
OL,6,Frain or drizzle in places. The best of
OL,7,Fany drier and brighter spells will be
OL,8,Fin the far west. Maximum Temperature
OL,9,F9C.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FConditions stay mostly dry with bright
OL,13,For sunny spells at times. Cloud will
OL,14,Fhowever thicken during the nights
OL,15,Fbringing the chance of patchy light
OL,16,Fovernight rain in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
